.TH SHAIRPORT-AIRPLAY2 1 "July 2025" "HiFiBerry" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
shairport-airplay2 \- AirPlay 2 compatible audio receiver
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B shairport-airplay2
[\fIOPTION\fR]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B shairport-airplay2
is an AirPlay 2 compatible audio receiver that allows iOS and macOS devices to stream audio to this device. This is the AirPlay 2 version that supports enhanced features like multi-room audio.
.SH OPTIONS
For a complete list of options, see the shairport-sync(1) manual page.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/shairport-sync.conf
Main configuration file
.TP
.I /var/lib/shairport/shairport-sync.conf
Runtime configuration file
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR shairport (1),
.BR start-shairport (1),
.BR shairport-sync (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Original shairport-sync by Mike Brady. AirPlay 2 version packaged by HiFiBerry.
